# RFC 0048 Phase 1 (D2): only the committed placeholder index.html and this
# .gitignore are tracked. PR 3's `make ui` writes the real Svelte/Vite bundle
# (hashed JS/CSS, .vite/, etc.) into this directory — those are build artifacts
# and must never be committed. A clean checkout has only the placeholder; a
# release build has the real bundle; they never coexist in git.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
